{"t":"CDW","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"CDW Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","employees":14800,"hq":"Vernon Hills, IL, United States","website":"https://www.cdw.com","summary_en":"CDW Corporation provides information technology (IT) solutions in the United States, the United Kingdom, and Canada. It operates through three segments: Commercial, Government, and Education. The company offers discrete hardware and software products and services, as well as integrated IT solutions, including on-premise and cloud capabilities across hybrid infrastructure, digital experience, and security. It also provides hardware products comprising notebooks/mobile devices, tablets, network communications, collaboration hardware, data storage and servers, desktop computers, and other hardware; and software products, such as cloud solutions, software assurance, application suites, security, virtualization, collaboration and productivity applications, operating systems, and network management. In addition, the company offers advisory and design, software development, implementation, and managed services, as well as warranties. It serves business, government, education, and healthcare customers. The company was formerly known as CDW Computer Centers, Inc. and changed its name to CDW Corporation in June 2003. CDW Corporation was founded in 1984 and is based in Vernon Hills, Illinois.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"CDW Corporation은 미국, 영국 및 캐나다에서 정보 기술(IT) 솔루션을 제공합니다. 상업, 정부 및 교육의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 하이브리드 인프라, 디지털 경험 및 보안 전반에 걸쳐 온프레미스 및 클라우드 기능을 포함한 개별 하드웨어 및 소프트웨어 제품과 서비스는 물론 통합 IT 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 노트북/모바일 장치, 태블릿, 네트워크 통신, 협업 하드웨어, 데이터 스토리지 및 서버, 데스크톱 컴퓨터 및 기타 하드웨어로 구성된 하드웨어 제품을 제공합니다. 클라우드 솔루션, 소프트웨어 보증, 애플리케이션 제품군, 보안, 가상화, 협업 및 생산성 애플리케이션, 운영 체제, 네트워크 관리와 같은 소프트웨어 제품이 포함됩니다. 또한 이 회사는 자문 및 설계, 소프트웨어 개발, 구현, 관리 서비스는 물론 보증도 제공합니다. 기업, 정부, 교육 및 의료 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 CDW Computer Centers, Inc.로 알려져 있었으며 2003년 6월에 CDW Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. CDW Corporation은 1984년에 설립되었으며 일리노이주 버논 힐스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":171.775,"mcap":21439119360.0,"pe":20.043756,"fpe":13.767155,"peg":null,"ps":0.87444144,"pb":8.146014,"ev_ebitda":13.284,"div":1.57,"beta":0.924,"hi52":175.19,"lo52":97.12},"fin":{"rev":24517500928.0,"rev_g":0.177,"eps_g":0.113,"gross":0.21003,"op":0.07343,"net":0.04483,"roe":0.42472,"fcf":867612480.0,"cash":1538700032.0,"debt":7866800128.0,"de":298.448,"eps":8.57,"feps":12.47716},"own":{"short":0.0783,"inst":1.13045,"insider":0.00457},"analyst":{"n":9,"mean":184.11111,"median":190.0,"high":204.0,"low":148.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.8,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":5,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":5,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":5,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":5,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":195.0,"priorPriceTarget":159.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":195.0,"priorPriceTarget":170.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":170.0,"priorPriceTarget":150.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-21","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":148.0,"priorPriceTarget":150.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-08","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":150.0,"priorPriceTarget":123.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-06","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Overweight","